WEBVTT

00:03.130 --> 00:04.680
Some crazy stuff happened.

00:05.260 --> 00:11.180
But thanks to Pops, Tenko and the others don't know what went on while I was human.

00:12.840 --> 00:14.460
Summer break is over.

00:15.250 --> 00:17.170
All sorts of stuff happened.

00:17.850 --> 00:22.320
But in the end, even though Samatarou and Kumiko went through a lot before she transferred...

00:24.940 --> 00:28.610
Hmm... I wonder if that means Samatarou got rejected again or something.

00:29.970 --> 00:32.850
Well, anyway, Samatarou and I...

00:35.990 --> 00:37.010
Lots of things happened with us, too!

00:38.170 --> 00:41.700
Hmm, I don't think "lots of things" is enough to explain it clearly.

00:42.500 --> 00:43.060
Why's that?

00:44.250 --> 00:46.380
Well, I guess I should be grateful to Pops.

00:46.880 --> 00:48.880
But he went on a business trip to Heaven so suddenly.

00:49.210 --> 00:51.190
I'm kinda worried he won't be able to come back any time soon.

00:53.490 --> 00:54.970
Someone talking about me?

00:58.560 --> 01:00.620
<i>And he hits! Okay okay!</i>

01:00.850 --> 01:03.800
<i>It's out of the park! What a come from behind clincher home run!</i>

01:03.800 --> 01:05.820
Alright! Yeah!

01:06.270 --> 01:08.720
I wonder what he meant by "that".

01:13.300 --> 01:15.720
I wonder if it's okay for me to think he meant it "that way".

01:39.800 --> 01:45.120
dare mo shiranai basho de

01:39.800 --> 01:45.120
In a place unknown to everyone

01:45.940 --> 01:50.800
asa ga umare hajimeru

01:45.940 --> 01:50.800
The dawn is being born

01:51.160 --> 01:57.240
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

01:51.160 --> 01:57.240
The wishes you made upon a star

01:57.240 --> 02:03.140
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

01:57.240 --> 02:03.140
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:03.440 --> 02:12.050
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:03.440 --> 02:12.050
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

02:15.240 --> 02:18.370
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

02:15.240 --> 02:18.370
And my voice envelops the entire world

02:18.390 --> 02:21.460
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

02:18.390 --> 02:21.460
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

02:21.480 --> 02:24.390
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

02:21.480 --> 02:24.390
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

02:24.640 --> 02:27.530
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

02:24.640 --> 02:27.530
And you'll never really lose them

02:27.530 --> 02:30.610
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

02:27.530 --> 02:30.610
My fingers touch all of creation

02:30.610 --> 02:36.000
tobira akete haruka kanata e

02:30.610 --> 02:36.000
Open the door and escape to a distant place

02:54.600 --> 02:57.150
Love Season? The One He's Interested in?

02:54.600 --> 02:57.150
Translation: Chikushou & rabidkimba; Timing, editing, muxing: Chikushou

03:08.320 --> 03:08.960
Hey!

03:11.190 --> 03:12.110
Samatarou...

03:13.750 --> 03:16.000
Jeez, c'mon Samatarou...

03:16.000 --> 03:19.920
Aren't you forgetting that Papa's not around to make sure things go your way?

03:20.540 --> 03:21.310
Time to break out the big guns.

03:25.420 --> 03:27.840
Section chief, it's growing too big!

03:28.760 --> 03:31.240
I don't think I could become a school administrator or anything like that.

03:31.790 --> 03:32.610
Sorry about that.

03:37.550 --> 03:40.570
Jeez, why'd you have to blurt out something so embarrassing in your sleep?

03:41.120 --> 03:43.330
Did I really say something like "section chief"?

03:43.370 --> 03:44.020
Sure did!

03:44.290 --> 03:45.020
I remember it clearly!

03:45.360 --> 03:46.900
And what the heck did you mean by "it's growing too big"?

03:47.220 --> 03:49.130
Just what part of the section chief were you talking about?

03:49.310 --> 03:49.990
What part?!

03:50.930 --> 03:52.620
How would I know about something like that?

03:52.830 --> 03:54.690
My, my, my!

03:54.890 --> 03:56.850
You guys having another married couple's quarrel?

03:57.690 --> 04:00.640
If you guys are already acting like that, you might as well have a kid together.

04:00.670 --> 04:01.130
Wh?

04:02.310 --> 04:02.980
A kid?

04:05.440 --> 04:06.270
Dumbass.

04:06.890 --> 04:08.750
H-hold on, Shinichi.

04:08.930 --> 04:10.420
We're not like that!

04:11.150 --> 04:12.480
I'm just kidding.

04:12.800 --> 04:16.440
Anyway, I've got some big news for you today, Samatarou!

04:17.120 --> 04:18.240
Huh? Wait up.

04:18.450 --> 04:20.370
Why aren't you guys excited about this?

04:20.500 --> 04:24.460
'Cause none of your "big news" has ever lived up to its name.

04:24.980 --> 04:26.560
That's not true!

04:26.730 --> 04:30.630
Try to remember! Remember all my nice news!

04:26.730 --> 04:30.630
Note: Shinichi is going to be using lots of Engl/rish. I'm just going to try to use it without changes, which will make this all a bit weird.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.570
Samatarou...

04:32.250 --> 04:35.210
If you're don't hurry up and get to the school store, they're gonna run out of yakisoba bread.

04:35.460 --> 04:36.490
Oh, that's right!

04:37.330 --> 04:38.840
STOP!

04:39.420 --> 04:41.480
Today's news is amazing. Seriously.

04:42.350 --> 04:46.210
Hey, please give me a listen. C'mon, please, Samacchin!

04:46.210 --> 04:48.330
What the Hell? You're creeping me out.

04:48.540 --> 04:51.000
Listen? Hey! Hey! Hey!

04:49.950 --> 04:51.840
--Fine. I'll listen to you already!

04:52.290 --> 04:53.930
I'd like to make an announcement!

04:55.200 --> 05:00.990
In the class next door there's this plain, quiet, totally boring girl. True story.

05:04.680 --> 05:05.810
Listen until I'm done!

05:05.870 --> 05:07.810
Don't blame me if soup starts pouring out of your ears!

05:05.870 --> 05:07.810
Note: This appears to be a strange expression that indicates total surprise.

05:08.320 --> 05:10.150
Soup doesn't pour out of ears.

05:11.010 --> 05:12.510
It does, it will!

05:12.620 --> 05:13.730
It happens to me!

05:13.970 --> 05:16.750
Miso soup, pork miso soup, and fish miso soup came out yesterday!

05:17.180 --> 05:18.670
Then show me.

05:18.820 --> 05:20.560
Alright, I'll show you then!

05:20.940 --> 05:21.760
Here!

05:22.270 --> 05:30.390
Bam! Wait, crap! Today's not a good day. Why not, c'mon... come out! You've always done it before!

05:26.590 --> 05:27.980
--Sure, sure.

05:27.980 --> 05:31.340
--Enough talk about soup, can you just tell us?

05:31.430 --> 05:33.590
I'll start the announcement over!

05:34.620 --> 05:37.120
That's right. That girl is, like...

05:37.440 --> 05:42.680
Somehow after summer break, she turned into this totally hot and lively chick.

05:42.860 --> 05:46.050
Something definitely happened during summer break.

05:46.370 --> 05:47.160
I'm sure of it!

05:48.360 --> 05:50.160
It's, like... freakin' amazing!

05:51.270 --> 05:52.440
Think that's enough of that?

05:52.850 --> 05:53.430
Yeah, plenty.

05:53.940 --> 05:56.230
Then, I'm gonna head to the school store.

05:56.600 --> 05:57.340
See you later.

05:58.370 --> 05:59.100
Wait up.

05:59.230 --> 05:59.890
Why're you leaving?

06:00.060 --> 06:03.040
You're not interested? You don't wanna go check her out?

06:03.040 --> 06:04.390
Not at all.

06:04.660 --> 06:07.150
I don't get it? Why? I mean, like, what?

06:07.470 --> 06:08.990
You guys are weird.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.960
You're the weird one.

06:12.950 --> 06:16.390
Jeez, all you ever do is talk about girls.

06:16.580 --> 06:18.390
Can't you think about something else for once?

06:19.450 --> 06:21.930
Fine. I don't need jerks like you!

06:22.150 --> 06:23.710
I'll go check her out by myself!

06:24.830 --> 06:26.050
Idiots!

06:32.960 --> 06:35.670
Excuse me! Do you have any yakisoba bread?

06:36.060 --> 06:39.400
Ah. I'm sorry. We're sold out for the day.

06:39.640 --> 06:40.790
Aww.

06:40.850 --> 06:43.100
Whatever's the matter, little Samatarou?

06:43.230 --> 06:46.030
You've never missed out on your precious bread before.

06:46.100 --> 06:49.160
You were such a wonderful little boy!

06:49.240 --> 06:51.640
So, so. You're not interested?

06:51.920 --> 06:54.910
That chick's changed, I'm telling you. She's changed!

06:55.730 --> 06:56.280
Don't care.

06:56.780 --> 06:59.280
Then, how about this yakisoba bread?

07:01.040 --> 07:01.460
Interested!

07:03.110 --> 07:03.970
That settles it.

07:11.440 --> 07:12.830
Ah, this sucks.

07:13.170 --> 07:15.390
This is all I can think about when I'm alone.

07:17.710 --> 07:19.040
Is it okay to believe that?

07:19.630 --> 07:20.640
What should I do?

07:23.310 --> 07:24.790
Stuff was better in the old days.

07:25.280 --> 07:30.060
I could happily help Samatarou through his troubles without a second thought.

07:33.030 --> 07:34.170
I guess I'll believe it.

07:37.590 --> 07:40.140
Hey. We're not going to the class next door?

07:42.280 --> 07:44.270
Ta-da! We're here!

07:44.700 --> 07:46.990
Huh? She's gonna show up in a place like this?

07:47.200 --> 07:49.020
Nope. Non, non.

07:49.510 --> 07:52.340
Actually, during 5th hour that class has P.E.

07:52.510 --> 07:55.460
And on the second floor, the girls change!

07:55.800 --> 07:56.360
You!

07:56.640 --> 07:59.360
That's right! If we climb this tree, we can see it all!

07:59.360 --> 08:02.440
"See it all"? Isn't that some sorta crime?

08:03.570 --> 08:04.790
Don't worry about it.

08:04.980 --> 08:06.740
It's just for a second, man.

08:07.210 --> 08:08.300
"Just for a second"?!

08:08.880 --> 08:09.950
Hey, Shinichi!

08:12.000 --> 08:14.080
Samatarou, come on, come on!

08:14.250 --> 08:16.670
Hurry up! I don't call where we'll be sitting my special "pink spot" for nothing!

08:16.860 --> 08:17.610
Pin...

08:19.410 --> 08:21.590
I shouldn't feel like I'm doing something dirty here!

08:21.810 --> 08:24.010
This is studying to become a better human, too!

08:24.120 --> 08:24.520
Yeah!

08:28.120 --> 08:31.500
Welcome! Behold, the doorway to Heaven!

08:33.960 --> 08:34.730
But, umm...

08:35.270 --> 08:35.910
What?

08:36.830 --> 08:38.730
If we can see it all from here...

08:38.930 --> 08:41.560
Can't they see us, too?

08:45.780 --> 08:49.050
Shush! It's time for the doorway to Heaven to open!

08:49.310 --> 08:50.050
Yeah, I heard you.

08:50.440 --> 08:53.310
But, I'm trying to tell you that they can probably see us from there...

08:53.650 --> 08:55.400
Who cares if they see us?

08:55.660 --> 08:56.630
It's 50/50.

08:57.110 --> 08:58.080
Give and take!

08:58.210 --> 08:59.580
They show us theirs and we show them ours!

08:59.580 --> 09:00.840
As if I'd do something like that!

09:01.510 --> 09:02.490
It's hot...

09:02.490 --> 09:04.610
I wish we had an air-conditioner in here.

09:11.730 --> 09:13.620
Woah, what's that?

09:13.620 --> 09:16.890
Girls just recklessly show that much skin around each other?

09:17.230 --> 09:18.990
Well, it's only girls...

09:19.070 --> 09:23.610
In times like this, girls let their guard way down, comrade Samatarou!

09:24.040 --> 09:25.050
I see!

09:25.790 --> 09:28.260
Check it out! That girl with the braids!

09:30.120 --> 09:33.560
That's the girl who suddenly became cute out of nowhere during summer break!

09:34.440 --> 09:37.420
Before that, she had a pretty dark look to her.

09:38.100 --> 09:38.850
Let's see...

09:39.880 --> 09:42.270
Samatarou, you still at the school store?

09:43.020 --> 09:43.970
Where are you now?

09:45.930 --> 09:47.770
Woah. What... What're you doing?

09:50.650 --> 09:53.060
What do you think you're doing? We'll be caught!

09:54.240 --> 09:54.810
What?

09:55.260 --> 09:56.160
Did you hear someone out there?

09:57.680 --> 09:58.580
Is someone there?

09:58.650 --> 09:59.670
It's just your imagination.

09:59.850 --> 10:00.700
There's nobody around.

10:01.040 --> 10:01.750
Oh.

10:02.160 --> 10:02.900
Just my imagination, huh?

10:07.400 --> 10:08.730
Samatarou, grab hold!

10:08.940 --> 10:09.860
Grab that branch!

10:14.650 --> 10:15.730
Are you serious?

10:19.450 --> 10:20.500
Samatarou?

10:22.340 --> 10:24.010
Samatarou, Samatarou!

10:25.420 --> 10:26.230
What happened?

10:26.230 --> 10:27.240
You okay?

10:33.320 --> 10:34.790
Te-Tenko!

10:34.860 --> 10:36.740
What the hell you think you were doing?

10:37.400 --> 10:38.000
Well, uh...

10:38.070 --> 10:39.970
This was... studying!

10:42.560 --> 10:45.770
Jeez! Sometimes I can't believe the crap you try to pull!

10:47.180 --> 10:48.940
Hey, did I land someplace bad?!

10:50.550 --> 10:51.440
Samatarou.

10:51.830 --> 10:56.050
Take over for me... carry on... in my place.

11:02.940 --> 11:03.660
Man...

11:04.730 --> 11:05.660
Sorry.

11:06.210 --> 11:08.120
I already got a hold of Mama, okay?

11:08.560 --> 11:09.420
Eh?

11:10.410 --> 11:12.310
Why do you have to tell her everything...

11:12.720 --> 11:16.160
While Papa is out, Mama is watching over you.

11:18.090 --> 11:19.720
Make sure to close the door all the way.

11:20.780 --> 11:23.380
Okay, make sure to face your mom like a man.

11:23.380 --> 11:26.370
Samatarou, are you okay???

11:26.370 --> 11:27.640
What was that?

11:33.030 --> 11:36.000
Welcome home! How is this, does it move you?

11:36.000 --> 11:37.270
Are you idiots?!

11:38.280 --> 11:41.070
Samatarou!

11:41.330 --> 11:44.870
You fell out of a tree? My, things like that do sometimes happen!

11:44.870 --> 11:47.410
Gods falling out of trees...

11:47.850 --> 11:52.410
But I'm glad! Glad you're safe! Your safety is the most important thing to me!

11:53.620 --> 11:56.970
How do you like it, Samatarou? Mom hugging you like that, you must be happy!

11:59.190 --> 12:01.790
Probably. That looks painful.

12:02.360 --> 12:03.440
Eh? Painful?

12:05.400 --> 12:09.390
What? Who could do such a terrible thing to you?

12:09.710 --> 12:11.230
It's obviously you, Mama!

12:11.550 --> 12:14.970
Me? Couldn't be...!

12:15.280 --> 12:17.060
You must be doing this on purpose.

12:24.280 --> 12:28.210
With her breasts... Ow, this is too funny, my stomach! I give! I give!

12:28.210 --> 12:31.760
Get a hold of yourself! Samatarou! Samatarou!

12:32.450 --> 12:36.000
I think he fainted.

12:48.850 --> 12:52.250
Jeez, I understand being concerned, but that's taking it too far!

12:52.530 --> 12:54.440
Now, now, it's not that bad.

12:54.440 --> 12:57.090
It's not good for Samatarou.

13:00.510 --> 13:02.210
Delicious!

13:02.530 --> 13:03.020
Hey...

13:03.400 --> 13:05.070
Did something happen between you and Samatarou?

13:05.270 --> 13:05.590
Eh?

13:06.170 --> 13:10.600
It's like there's some sort of strange atmosphere between you guys since right before summer break...

13:10.600 --> 13:11.370
You know?

13:11.840 --> 13:14.410
S-strange? What do you mean?

13:14.550 --> 13:16.180
Well, for example:

13:16.610 --> 13:21.230
Giving off vibes stronger than the smell of a lemon of a silly, first-crush-style puppy love?

13:21.490 --> 13:23.350
What do you mean by that?

13:24.180 --> 13:26.260
Did you do something to Samatarou?

13:26.780 --> 13:29.990
T-t-there's no way I could have done something like that!

13:29.990 --> 13:31.060
Nothing happened.

13:31.250 --> 13:32.380
Excuse me!

13:36.210 --> 13:38.420
Wow, she turned bright red.

13:39.190 --> 13:43.450
"Life is short! Fall in love, maidens! Seize the day!"

13:43.660 --> 13:46.120
Well she's not going to die since she's an angel...

13:51.110 --> 13:52.410
Nothing happened, nothing happened!

13:52.780 --> 13:54.730
That wasn't anything like that...!

13:56.270 --> 13:58.790
I mean, Samatarou was just peeping at girls today!

13:59.650 --> 14:05.680
But even Misa noticed, so maybe Samatarou feels the same way I do!

14:09.150 --> 14:11.290
Nah, I doubt it's like that.

14:13.920 --> 14:15.270
Or maybe...!

14:16.940 --> 14:19.770
Jeez, I just don't know!

14:30.380 --> 14:32.160
Good morning.

14:32.780 --> 14:35.940
Hm? Nothing's been made for breakfast?

14:36.290 --> 14:37.940
What's up with Tenko?

14:38.700 --> 14:41.550
Hmm, she really must be smitten.

14:41.700 --> 14:42.210
Huh?

14:44.290 --> 14:48.760
I'm sorry. I don't feel that well, so I'm going to take a break from chores today.

14:49.380 --> 14:52.080
Can you say sorry to Mama for me?

14:52.340 --> 14:54.480
Not feeling well? But you're an angel!

14:54.970 --> 14:57.520
What was common sense for me to do yesterday is a bad idea today!

14:57.920 --> 14:59.760
Well then, good night.

15:01.610 --> 15:02.650
What was that...

15:02.650 --> 15:04.650
It just means she's young.

15:04.650 --> 15:06.080
Don't make her cry too much!

15:06.080 --> 15:10.020
Stop saying things that don't make sense! I'm going out to eat.

15:10.310 --> 15:11.790
Where are you going?

15:11.980 --> 15:13.630
Does it really matter?

15:15.200 --> 15:17.360
That manner... and "eating out", too.

15:17.980 --> 15:20.890
Tenko is staying inside, and... Smells like an affair!

15:26.390 --> 15:27.740
No way...

15:35.270 --> 15:37.520
Samatarou! I'm coming too!

15:37.640 --> 15:38.330
What?

15:38.330 --> 15:40.170
Why should you care! C'mon, let's go!

15:40.410 --> 15:42.100
H-hey, wait a second!

15:42.140 --> 15:44.750
What, something wrong with going together?

15:44.900 --> 15:47.340
Not really, but... let me go!

15:47.340 --> 15:49.340
Nothing to be embarrassed about, is it?

15:49.400 --> 15:51.960
If my friends saw this, they'd completely misunderstand what's going on!

15:52.220 --> 15:54.300
We're siblings. It's fine!

15:54.300 --> 15:55.810
It's shameful!

15:56.010 --> 15:57.010
Shameful?

15:57.460 --> 15:59.750
Your sister's... so sad...

16:00.910 --> 16:02.150
My sister...?

16:02.750 --> 16:04.250
Ah, that's that Goddess magic!

16:04.310 --> 16:06.300
Argh, that was close!

16:07.260 --> 16:08.890
Damn, it didn't work.

16:09.510 --> 16:11.500
What are you going to do, making your brother fall in love with you?

16:11.670 --> 16:13.020
Don't do stuff like that!

16:13.230 --> 16:14.260
Okay, okay.

16:14.390 --> 16:15.680
Well, let's go.

16:18.740 --> 16:19.610
Is this...

16:24.920 --> 16:25.750
Could it be?

16:29.160 --> 16:31.100
What? A hospital?

16:31.640 --> 16:34.590
Since Shinichi is hospitalized, of course.

16:35.520 --> 16:36.290
What?

16:36.290 --> 16:38.390
I thought something interesting was going to happen.

16:38.390 --> 16:41.240
Bo-ring! I'm going home

16:41.240 --> 16:41.750
Well then!

16:42.090 --> 16:42.900
Well then?

16:44.820 --> 16:48.980
Wait a second... could it about be some sexy nurse?

16:49.430 --> 16:51.860
Of course, that's what he was going for.

16:53.750 --> 16:56.340
Samatarou, you little player!

16:56.450 --> 16:58.290
What? Me?

16:58.410 --> 17:00.770
What are you hoping for?

17:09.110 --> 17:11.750
So nice, so nice!

17:11.880 --> 17:14.920
Wow, Misa coming to see how I'm doing...

17:15.190 --> 17:17.700
I'm moved! I'm on the brink of tears here!

17:17.980 --> 17:19.320
I'm seriously happy!

17:19.320 --> 17:21.720
It's almost painful!

17:21.870 --> 17:25.770
Oh Shinichi, you're always so good with your mouth.

17:26.280 --> 17:30.110
If you feel fine just thanks to me, I'll come anytime you want!

17:30.860 --> 17:33.830
After hearing about what happened from Samatarou, I've been so worried!

17:34.620 --> 17:35.650
Really?

17:35.850 --> 17:39.950
Well, I shouldn't stay for too long, so I'll excuse myself.

17:40.700 --> 17:42.390
Are you leaving already?

17:42.670 --> 17:45.470
Samatarou, make sure to look after him.

17:45.770 --> 17:46.570
What?

17:46.760 --> 17:50.590
Once you get better, we should play together~

17:53.460 --> 17:54.700
Okay~

17:59.170 --> 18:01.680
Well then, everyone, I must excuse myself.

18:05.120 --> 18:07.310
Who was that beautiful person just now?

18:11.030 --> 18:12.480
Well, he was really going to visit him.

18:12.480 --> 18:13.680
What a boring guy.

18:14.200 --> 18:18.350
Jeez, what does Tenko see in Samatarou?

18:21.520 --> 18:23.190
What should I do?

18:23.360 --> 18:26.670
What should I do, what should I do?

18:43.150 --> 18:43.540
Here.

18:43.790 --> 18:44.420
Thanks.

18:51.560 --> 18:54.220
Being hospitalized really does change a person.

18:55.160 --> 18:58.600
I've said goodbye to the stupid guy I was yesterday.

18:59.200 --> 19:01.300
What's this all of a sudden?

19:01.660 --> 19:03.930
It's like I found a reason for living, I guess.

19:05.200 --> 19:07.140
You see that tree over there?

19:08.210 --> 19:09.260
A tree?

19:09.260 --> 19:11.080
You're not going to... again?

19:11.570 --> 19:15.260
What? No, not on top of a tree, below it.

19:15.720 --> 19:18.560
Over there... Do you see the girl in the wheelchair?

19:19.300 --> 19:19.920
Below?

19:21.800 --> 19:24.050
I've fallen in love with her.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.490
Huh? Love?

19:25.930 --> 19:26.900
It's really serious.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.270
It's like it was fate or something.

19:28.970 --> 19:31.900
But you're... how about the girl in the class next door?

19:32.460 --> 19:33.400
I don't care about her.

19:34.260 --> 19:36.890
I told you, I've said goodbye to who I was yesterday!

19:37.100 --> 19:38.300
Yeah...

19:38.880 --> 19:40.700
You haven't changed at all!

19:41.060 --> 19:43.380
She's probably about the same age as us...

19:43.820 --> 19:45.970
I think she likes that spot.

19:46.310 --> 19:48.360
Why is she holding a pillow?

19:49.010 --> 19:52.850
She probably has to be holding onto something to be comfortable.

19:52.850 --> 19:54.870
She has nerve damage or something.

19:55.420 --> 19:57.290
Oh, you talked to her already?

19:57.690 --> 19:59.290
No, I'm just guessing.

19:59.450 --> 20:00.310
Oh.

20:01.990 --> 20:03.710
It's like I've seen her before...

20:04.220 --> 20:05.290
Maybe it's my imagination.

20:05.910 --> 20:07.500
How is she? Cute, right?

20:07.710 --> 20:09.530
Hm? Yeah...

20:09.530 --> 20:10.360
Right?

20:10.920 --> 20:12.850
What's her name?

20:13.000 --> 20:13.550
No clue.

20:13.980 --> 20:16.420
No clue? That's not like you!

20:16.550 --> 20:19.390
If she's hospitalized, wouldn't her name be on the door?

20:19.550 --> 20:22.090
The thing is, only her name isn't on the door.

20:22.240 --> 20:22.760
What?

20:23.120 --> 20:25.840
Even is I ask around, the nurses say they can't tell me who it is.

20:26.690 --> 20:30.010
Then again, a mystery like that makes it even better!

20:30.350 --> 20:31.400
I've fallen in love!

20:31.550 --> 20:32.640
No, no, how about...

20:32.640 --> 20:34.140
I love you too much.

20:34.400 --> 20:38.850
No how about, maybe this is a test of love that the Gods have given me!

20:38.850 --> 20:40.520
Okay, okay, I get it.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.700
But, that girl...

20:43.190 --> 20:46.660
I know I've seen her somewhere before. No mistake about it.

20:46.850 --> 20:48.860
But who could it have been?

20:48.860 --> 20:49.480
School?

20:49.660 --> 20:50.620
No, that's not right.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.620
Where could it have been?

20:52.890 --> 20:53.710
I'm home.

20:54.790 --> 20:56.180
So you weren't meeting up with some chick?

20:56.180 --> 20:56.940
Huh?

20:57.040 --> 20:58.970
I was convinced it was an affair.

20:59.370 --> 21:01.230
Seriously, I'm disappointed!

21:01.400 --> 21:03.010
An affair?

21:03.290 --> 21:05.360
Stop making things up on your own.

21:06.410 --> 21:07.060
What?

21:07.440 --> 21:11.420
Then Tenko acting weird doesn't make any sense.

21:11.570 --> 21:13.930
After all, she's still not coming down.

21:14.010 --> 21:15.290
No way!

21:16.580 --> 21:19.170
Meme, have you seen Tenko recently?

21:19.300 --> 21:19.900
No.

21:20.050 --> 21:23.510
It says on her door not to bother her.

21:23.730 --> 21:24.600
Really...

21:24.910 --> 21:26.450
Are you two... fighting?

21:26.850 --> 21:27.220
No.

21:27.560 --> 21:29.590
You better make up to her.

21:30.040 --> 21:32.140
I haven't done anything I should apologize for!

21:33.720 --> 21:36.420
Good, good. This is youth! That's youth for you!

21:36.420 --> 21:38.050
Youth, youth.

21:55.210 --> 21:57.240
It happened.

22:01.970 --> 22:02.850
Samatarou's...

22:06.890 --> 22:08.010
With Samatarou...

22:08.890 --> 22:09.910
I...

22:23.310 --> 22:24.780
I'm pregnant!

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh, please, God, allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:04.020 --> 24:05.180
What's wrong, Tenko?

24:05.180 --> 24:06.340
Explain this to me!

24:06.340 --> 24:07.980
I can't tell you!

24:08.220 --> 24:10.190
Because, Samatarou and my...

24:11.880 --> 24:12.910
BABY?

24:12.970 --> 24:14.640
Let's raise him well, Papa!

24:15.020 --> 24:15.840
Papa!

24:16.150 --> 24:16.990
Mama!

24:17.390 --> 24:19.640
So... so cute!

24:20.480 --> 24:23.730
Next time, on Kamisama Kazoku! Tenko's Baby!

24:25.040 --> 24:26.680
This kid's growing up too fast!
